Derived from Oxidized as of commit d7f51c2, and modified for glazed:

- glazed/lib/glazed/dialects/{aireos,aruba_instant,awplus,eos,ios,junos,nec_ix,routeros}.rb
  Prompts, command sequences, output cleanup and secret patterns ported
  from lib/oxidized/model/{awplus,ios,junos,necix,aireos,eos,arubainstant,routeros}.rb.
- glazed/spec/fixtures/dialects/{aruba_instant,ios,junos,routeros}/*
  Additions to the device simulations in third_party/oxidized, and the
  outputs collected from them (*.collected.txt, *.redacted.txt).
- glazed/spec/support/simulation.rb
  Reads Oxidized's device simulation format (spec/model/model_helper.rb).

